    seoDescription:
      "What makes a room a bedroom in Florida: size, ceiling height, egress, smoke alarms, light and the closet myth, plus garage conversion tips. Verify locally.",
    excerpt:
      "A legal bedroom is defined by code basics like size, ceiling height, an escape opening and smoke alarms, not by a closet. Here is what generally applies in Florida and what to confirm locally.",
